{"path":"io/basic_ostringstream/view","title":"std::basic_ostringstream<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::view","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ostringstream&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;::</span>view","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ostringstream/view","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Obtains a std::basic_string_view over the underlying string object. Equivalent to return rdbuf()->view();.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1254\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string_view</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> view<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Obtains a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\">std::basic_string_view</a></span> over the underlying string object. Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> rdbuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>view<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\">std::basic_string_view</a></span> over the underlying string object.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;i